    "title": "About Midnight Tales Horror",
    "text": "Midnight Tales Horror is a YouTube channel for dark, cinematic horror stories and anime-style storytelling.\n\nOur main series, Dark Phoenix: The AI Butcher, follows Shrikant, Vrinda and Arrow through a world of new powers, hidden secrets and dangerous choices. Season 2, Dark Phoenix: Godfall, streams from December 25, 2026.\n\nBesides the series, we also share original songs from the story. Subscribe to the channel and stay active so you never miss a new episode.",
